      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the pointer. I checked it on current master in a debug build with the linux-cp test module.\n\n- master plus the regression test of this change, without any fix: the test fails; the entry 192.168.53.0/24 keeps an \"exclusive\" drop path next to the Linux path.\n- master plus only the fib_entry_src.c hunk of 47078 and the same test: it passes (33 tests in test_linux_cp).\n\nSo 47078 fixes the cause for this case at the FIB level, and this change is redundant for it. I tested only the IPv4 unicast case, not the MPLS EOS and non-EOS entries this change also touches. I will abandon this change once 47078 is merged. If useful, I can send the regression test as a separate test-only change on top of 47078.\n\nFYI the test hunks of 47078 conflict with current master (test_linux_cp.py, vpp_qemu_utils.py) and need a rebase.",
